<title>POLAND: Poland invites bids for Wiek SA cement plant.</title>
<headline>Poland invites bids for Wiek SA cement plant.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish privatisation ministry is inviting bids for no less than 10 percent of the Wiek SA cement plant, the ministry said in a newspaper advertisement.</p>
<p>It said the deadline for bids was September 27.</p>
<p>The ministry will offer up to 20 percent of Wiek's shares to its employees and keep five percent for reprivatisation claims.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
